{
  "title": { "zh": "先证哪一个" },
  "adds": ["defer"],
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "一个 ? 留在两个目标里时，先证哪一个，就由哪一个来定它。逆用<part-ref to=\"part:exI\"></part-ref>、再拼成以后，两个目标是 ?t是人、?t喜欢安。<part-ref to=\"part:assumption\"></part-ref>取第一条对得上的已知：先证「?t是人」，?t 就成了茜，可茜不喜欢安，第二个目标便证不下去。"
      }
    },
    { "t": { "zh": "新元件「目标后移」：把第一个目标移到最后。" } }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "s-defer",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "proved",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } }],
      "tests": [
        { "goal": "∃x. Human(x) ∧ Likes(x, i)", "hyps": ["Human(k)", "Human(j)", "Likes(j, i)"] },
        { "goal": "∃x. Bird(x) ∧ Flies(x)", "hyps": ["Bird(i)", "Bird(l)", "Flies(l)"] }
      ],
      "brief": { "zh": "设计一个证明助手，证完每一个目标。" },
      "hint": [{ "zh": "哪个目标对得上的已知少？" }],
      "solution": [
        "c0r0 = exI()",
        "c1r0 = andI()",
        "c0 = rule(in, c0r0)",
        "c1 = rule(c0, c1r0)",
        "c2 = defer(c1)",
        "c3 = assumption(c2)",
        "c4 = assumption(c3)",
        "out <- c4"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
